      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STILTON SHINE (1) lines up chasing another win after scorching around this track over 720m in 41.99 on August 20. Should be in this for a long way. NO SHAME (5) collided in the run and missed the frame but ran fast time regardless when a 13 length fourth (42.96) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Safe beginner but tricky box to overcome. Worth following up. GO FORWARD JACKI (7) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 10 lengths (42.73) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 720m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Overdue and is among the main hopes. FANTASTIC STORM (2) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
